      <guid>http://localhost:1313/raspberry-pi-rtsp-viewer/</guid>
      <description>&lt;figure class=&#34;responsive-image&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img &#xA;      src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/raspberry-pi-rtsp-viewer/hero_hu_312a9ebb2d81fe61.webp&#34;&#xA;      srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/raspberry-pi-rtsp-viewer/hero_hu_9ce08cf3c29933f2.webp 320w, http://localhost:1313/images/raspberry-pi-rtsp-viewer/hero_hu_f9819bc2569f9d83.webp 480w, http://localhost:1313/images/raspberry-pi-rtsp-viewer/hero_hu_9c5df3da93ef4d34.webp 768w, http://localhost:1313/images/raspberry-pi-rtsp-viewer/hero_hu_312a9ebb2d81fe61.webp 1024w, http://localhost:1313/images/raspberry-pi-rtsp-viewer/hero_hu_123452250f03bb9c.webp 1366w, http://localhost:1313/images/raspberry-pi-rtsp-viewer/hero_hu_fcb5c8331ac18a21.webp 1536w, http://localhost:1313/images/raspberry-pi-rtsp-viewer/hero_hu_d2532ef6ef9bd89d.webp 1920w, http://localhost:1313/images/raspberry-pi-rtsp-viewer/hero_hu_dd1bb3f24aefc9bc.webp 2560w, http://localhost:1313/images/raspberry-pi-rtsp-viewer/hero_hu_9bbea36665686f78.webp 3840w&#34;&#xA;      sizes=&#34;100vw&#34;&#xA;      width=&#34;100%&#34;&#xA;      style=&#34;max-width: 100%; height: auto; background-size: cover; background-image: url(data:image/webp;base64,UklGRoQBAABXRUJQVlA4IHgBAAAwBwCdASoqABwAPs1eokqjoqGVXAQAOwzE8wBXEVruEeZ3HpZBq/tcqZnn69ciexr05v6P1SpCSzj4dHba4mSJQAAA/v16l65TZ2bZvGCp8BLwj2H6C/dmznRbsuv&amp;#43;BWx92n/Y19CVbbRjptI&amp;#43;MOn9qAOCSR&amp;#43;lV1CN2Uu/TgUu8bTsOK5b9C3gq/9JzT769vj5H/NRA/&amp;#43;T/N6l6LzgEFq/pr&amp;#43;cD71Ava4W636kiAyfBwaYTuwAeiOD7WEBqJp5EiMe/JWOOAUzUQpZdA3q/Uehf2lVy/wzUDho3I/xR90qEAG9qtMtc9cUeWoJP9TRa1OHLRiLEwIJQfIqT1ssRcXgrwu1UtcToF4PdH90I1iCDC5/V&amp;#43;YgxQ4mDHey/to&amp;#43;ZtceL4EExW/dNDFBOPKC14fTWTRfqtCkwcMFjsFHpAkeMtXTMjCyv1GajBGYDmN/aqFX1ysSJm2qAZ6U7QS7NlgdmHIi3PgxIRdplb2svSw6MDOPvcl3A3AA);&#34;&#xA;      loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;      decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;      alt=&#34;ChatGPT generated image of the cube&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;  &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;My doorbell camera provides an RTSP stream, which made me think it would be perfect to display on a small dedicated screen. I built this using Jay Doscher’s excellent &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.doscher.com/arm-terminal-2-the-cube/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;ARM Terminal 2 - The Cube&lt;/a&gt;. I highly recommend taking a look at his blog, because if you&amp;rsquo;re reading this, you&amp;rsquo;re gonna love his stuff, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.doscher.com&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;doscher.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
